          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$\\hat p=40/80=0.50$, $\\pi_0=0.35$, $n=80$. The standard error uses the HYPOTHESIZED proportion: $\\sigma_{\\hat p}=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{\\pi_0(1-\\pi_0)}{n}}=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{0.35\\times0.65}{80}}=\\sqrt{0.00284375}\\approx0.053327$. So $Z=\\dfrac{0.50-0.35}{0.053327}\\approx2.81$. (Using $\\hat p$ in the denominator would give 2.68 — wrong for a hypothesis test.)</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>$\\hat p=40/80=0.50$, $\\pi_0=0.35$, $n=80$. Sai số chuẩn dùng tỉ lệ GIẢ ĐỊNH: $\\sigma_{\\hat p}=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{\\pi_0(1-\\pi_0)}{n}}=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{0.35\\times0.65}{80}}=\\sqrt{0.00284375}\\approx0.053327$. Vậy $Z=\\dfrac{0.50-0.35}{0.053327}\\approx2.81$. (Nếu lấy $\\hat p$ ở mẫu số sẽ ra 2.68 — sai với kiểm định giả thuyết.)</p></div>"
